        {
            "metadata": {
                "chunk_uuid": "3a5164f4-038a-45a2-90f3-68200cdf67f5",
                "document_uuid": "4c459cae-9efa-4519-9b01-5a612cb9ace3",
                "chunk_index": 6,
                "authority": "Merchant_Fraud",
                "document_title": "2509.18719v1",
                "chapter": "",
                "chapter_title": "",
                "section": "",
                "subsection": "",
                "heading": "",
                "page_start": 1,
                "page_end": 1
            },
            "text": "The reward function design includes:\n- **True Positive GMV**: `(action == 1) & (target == 1) * wgt`\n- **False Positive GMV**: `(action == 1) & (target == 0) * wgt`\n- **True Negative GMV**: `(action == 0) & (target == 0) * wgt`\n- **False Negative GMV**: `(action == 0) & (target == 1) * wgt`",
            "embedding": null,
            "embedding_text": null
        },
        {
            "metadata": {
                "chunk_uuid": "ff8c109e-a5d2-4356-ba5b-21ad276d82bb",
                "document_uuid": "4c459cae-9efa-4519-9b01-5a612cb9ace3",
                "chunk_index": 7,
                "authority": "Merchant_Fraud",
                "document_title": "2509.18719v1",
                "chapter": "",
                "chapter_title": "",
                "section": "",
                "subsection": "",
                "heading": "",
                "page_start": 1,
                "page_end": 1
            },
            "text": "Operational challenges include balancing Step 1 and Step 2 blocking actions to avoid excessive false positives (user friction) or false negatives (missed fraud). Key metrics include:\n- **Bad GMV Blocked Ratio**: Ratio of bad GMV blocked in Step 1 vs. Step 2.\n- **Total GMV Blocked Ratio**: Ratio of total GMV blocked in Step 1 vs. Step 2.",
            "embedding": null,
            "embedding_text": null
        },
        {
            "metadata": {
                "chunk_uuid": "6a24be84-622b-40cd-a178-342ad719c843",
                "document_uuid": "4c459cae-9efa-4519-9b01-5a612cb9ace3",
                "chunk_index": 8,
                "authority": "Merchant_Fraud",
                "document_title": "2509.18719v1",
                "chapter": "",
                "chapter_title": "",
                "section": "",
                "subsection": "",
                "heading": "",
                "page_start": 1,
                "page_end": 1
            },
            "text": "Mitigation strategies include:\n- **Iterative Reward Refinement**: Use reflection prompts to analyze failures and refine reward function parameters.\n- **Multi-Step Validation**: Ensure Step 1 and Step 2 blocking actions align with business goals (e.g., minimizing false positives in Step 1).\n- **LLM Prompt Engineering**: Leverage detailed prompts to guide LLMs in generating reward functions that balance precision, recall, and GMV impact.",
            "embedding": null,
            "embedding_text": null
        },
